day 2021.19

# Scanners report the beacons near them, relative to themselves, each in
# an unknown one of 24 orientations. Two scanners overlap when at least 12
# beacons are seen by both. Scanner 0 sets the coordinates.
# Part 1: how many beacons there are.
# Part 2: the largest Manhattan distance between two scanners.

